{title: In His presence, there’s fullness of joy}
{x_theme: joy}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/In His presence, there’s fullness of joy.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
In His presence, there’s fullness of joy
At His right hand are pleasures forevermore
Oh what fellowship divine, I am His and He is mine
In the presence of the Lord there’s fullness of joy
